  "remarks": "Oleg Sladkevich is a director of School No. 42 in Horlivka, in the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”, Ukraine. Oleg Sladkevich is also a deputy leader of the “United Russia” party in the Horlivka City Council in the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. Oleg Sladkevich participated in Russia’s so-called “special military operation” in 2022.",
